  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3269ab77e5738674b9fefab358f453ff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: I5
  Title: Copy and paste
  Summary: Right-click headers to copy and paste animations and steps, between players
    too. Source's Show holds a sound clip and a step dragged onto Pinned.
  Watch: Source, Target
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 754281912}
  - {fileID: 1935284178}
  - {fileID: 60279832}
  HowTo: "Right-click Source's Show \u2192 Copy Animation. On Target, right-click
    the Animations list \u2192 Paste Animation, then right-click Fade \u2192 Paste
    Animation Above. Copy one of Source's steps and Paste Step Below the first of
    Fade's steps. Play Target's pasted Show. Undo afterwards."
  Expect: Pasted animations are named 'Show 2' and 'Show 3' (names stay unique).
    The pasted Show still has its Pop clip and still spins Pinned. A step pasted
    under a WITH step joins its group (reads WITH). The menu has one divider above
    the tool's entries, not two.
  Needs: 5
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
