  Code: I7
  Title: Mirroring has to guess
  Summary: 'Step 0 has no From: there''s no exact start to mirror onto. Step 1''s
    From is Baseline and its To Absolute: swapping them changes which mode its path
    points are read in.'
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 48267038}
  HowTo: "Right-click Go \u2192 Duplicate as Mirrored. Read the Console and the new
    animation. Undo afterwards."
  Expect: 'Two warnings, each naming its step. Step 0 of the mirror is switched to
    FROM 1.5 with To Baseline 0 (a guess: back to rest). The path''s points are reversed
    but now read in Baseline mode, and the second warning says so.'
