  m_text: <b>Expect:</b> Type is grouped (moving and sizing, punch and shake, colour
    and fading, shaders, other) and sorted inside each group. Ease starts with Custom
    Curve, then Linear and Flash, then In, Out and In Out groups. Picking a type
    swaps the fields shown; Undo restores everything.
