  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: I3
  Title: One-button rows and tooltips
  Summary: Several rows are one control over several fields. Each cycles in place
    and has a tooltip.
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 489558104}
  HowTo: 'On Rows, click each in turn and hover it: Start (AFTER / WITH PREVIOUS),
    the FROM / TO button, a mode dropdown, Custom Path, Snapping, Play At Custom
    FPS, Interrupt Others'' two buttons. Try it at 125% UI scaling too.'
  Expect: Start toggles AFTER / WITH PREVIOUS. Snapping cycles DISABLED, ALL STEPS,
    PER STEP. Play At Custom FPS shows its FPS box on the same row while ticked.
    Interrupt Others shows STOP/COMPLETE and REPORT/SILENT only while ticked, and
    REPORT/SILENT only matters on COMPLETE. No label is clipped. The mode dropdown's
    tooltip lists only the modes it offers.
  Needs: 4
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
