  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: I8
  Title: The type check
  Summary: Every step of Broken but the last is wrong in a different way. Each shows
    a warning sign, a fading header and a reason; the last step still plays.
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 904326421}
  HowTo: 'Open Broken''s steps and read each warning. Narrow the Inspector: the warnings
    wrap. Preview Broken. Enter play mode and read the Console.'
  Expect: 'In order: ''Plain'' has no Canvas Group; Target Path "Stage/Plian" matches
    nothing; Shader has no property ''_Nope''; ''Plain'' has no UI Material Instance;
    No Clip; No Property picked; ''Plain'' has no TestGauge; TextMeshProUGUI.text
    is a string, not a float. Fields below each warning are greyed; the fields that
    fix it (Type, slot, path, Clip, Shader Property) aren''t. The sound with a bad
    path is warned about but not greyed - it still plays, on the shared source. Preview:
    only Plain''s punch moves. Play mode: the Console warns about the broken steps
    once, at start-up, and never again.'
  Needs: 23
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 1284
  StageHeight: 260
