  m_text: '<b>Expect:</b> Open Mirrored runs in reverse: the rows slide out first
    - Three, then Two, then One (the delays are flipped: Three 0, Two 0.1, One 0.2),
    each from rest to -300 - then the panel fades to 0, then Set Active switches
    it off. From and To are swapped; every ease is still Out Cubic. No warning in
    the Console. Mirror Step flips just that one step.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
