  m_text: <b>Expect:</b> The Inspector shows Second as one line with a Focus button.
    The window keeps showing it whatever is selected. Renamed or moved, it still
    finds it. Deleted, it says it's gone; after Undo it finds it again. Play in the
    window keeps playing while you select other things; closing the window stops
    and restores it.
