  m_text: '<b>Expect:</b> In order: ''Plain'' has no Canvas Group; Target Path "Stage/Plian"
    matches nothing; Shader has no property ''_Nope''; ''Plain'' has no UI Material
    Instance; No Clip; No Property picked; ''Plain'' has no TestGauge; TextMeshProUGUI.text
    is a string, not a float. Fields below each warning are greyed; the fields that
    fix it (Type, slot, path, Clip, Shader Property) aren''t. The sound with a bad
    path is warned about but not greyed - it still plays, on the shared source. Preview:
    only Plain''s punch moves. Play mode: the Console warns about the broken steps
    once, at start-up, and never again.'
