  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: I2
  Title: Type and Ease menus
  Summary: Both dropdowns are grouped menus, not alphabetical enum lists.
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1695327252}
  HowTo: Open Try Me's step. Open the Type dropdown, then the Ease dropdown. Pick
    a few, then Undo.
  Expect: Type is grouped (moving and sizing, punch and shake, colour and fading,
    shaders, other) and sorted inside each group. Ease starts with Custom Curve,
    then Linear and Flash, then In, Out and In Out groups. Picking a type swaps the
    fields shown; Undo restores everything.
